sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User / A2-001
  participant P as A2-002 Profiler
  participant I as A2-003 Incident Engine
  participant C as A2-004 Capture
  participant V as A2-007 Platform Policy
  participant S as A2-008 Store
  U->>P: open diagnose / validate DeviceProfile
  P-->>U: capabilities + UNKNOWNs
  U->>I: mark/review incident
  I->>I: query direct exit/start records available
  I->>V: request policy context if relevant
  V-->>I: versioned policy assessment / UNKNOWN
  alt direct evidence sufficient
    I-->>U: attribution + confidence + provenance
  else material evidence gap
    I->>C: request minimum evidence tier
    C-->>I: bounded bundle + observer cost
    I-->>U: revised attribution / remaining gap
  end
  I->>S: incident + evidence + attribution
  Note over U,S: No continuous recorder or privileged write is required for correctness
